<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Sunbeam Victa year net up 19 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Sunbeam Victa year net up 19 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     6.68 vs 4.26</p>
<p>    Net					3.97 vs 3.33</p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)		5.0 vs 5.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Sunbeam Victa holdings Ltd is an appliance and mower manufacturer. It is under takeover by GUD Holdings Ltd.  </p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	     1.25 vs nil</p>
<p>    Sales				  194.26 vs 182.79</p>
<p>    Other income			   0.18 vs   0.99</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			     6.5 vs  5.6</p>
<p>    Abnormal loss			  2.50 vs loss 0.93</p>
<p>Dividend is nil percent franked</p>
<p>Pay date Nov 12</p>
<p>Reg date Oct 25</p>
<p>    Tax					0.21 vs   nil</p>
<p>    Interest				 2.89 vs   2.79</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   5.44 vs   5.02</p>
<p>NOTE: Sunbeam said the abnormal losses reflected reorganisation costs and the defence of its takeover by GUD.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 973 1800</p>
</text>
